{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_17fd4c65296c6d73ffa4e5be34e760b87a1e82383e0fc43bf5346128bf0e8e0c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"plasma-ai/fractal@18793200c0d7 snapshot 448057f9da1ad062","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ee71cc728bb7779b7d03292268c36c8db3aded71841bca3813df130f8e789033"],"source_ids":["src_aa3a00d6d7ab5ff7b5801bbcc485ea9b"],"text":"The fractal CLI exposes commands such as 'fractal open' to launch the dashboard from a project root (requires an initialized fractal), with a --light flag for light terminal color schemes.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2731eef859ee02b9120860244c4b1c0c7465d362958a6a9d12dc6c8c50b6f958","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"plasma-ai/fractal@18793200c0d7 snapshot 448057f9da1ad062","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0bdb9813876e808be6c4c649f6f5e7fe960494c48278b9e7ca5e2b540f1b6886","slc_84b977a1f43edc8467e97c5bde2668e73e60fd3119a893def8295cdd3f6c4783"],"source_ids":["src_8065af0adf255028bd9d481965a173ba"],"text":"'node stop' waits for the in-flight agent to complete rather than tearing the running seat, and cascades over the target's entire subtree children-first; 'node kill' remains the immediate path and can reap booting spawns.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_38064d19540729b12ea6de440cab3b14ab349a21c6cab3023d586669bb17a657","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"plasma-ai/fractal@18793200c0d7 snapshot 448057f9da1ad062","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9d4abfc05ac279eed6878abaa8ff66bdd0ef785f5f0ffffc9c99987aaa984486"],"source_ids":["src_aa3a00d6d7ab5ff7b5801bbcc485ea9b"],"text":"Nodes run their agents without permission prompts by default: seeded configs disable approval gates (e.g. Claude bypassPermissions, Codex danger-full-access), and the per-node worktree isolates only the branch, not the filesystem or network.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3ec9812806f4f85adeb4fe3c3f68d995c04650e714826ddaaa4ec1107eec2921","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"plasma-ai/fractal@18793200c0d7 snapshot 448057f9da1ad062","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0ef354d9f57808bf1e71087ad50662375c3b1f56ca488f04d873730585db459c","slc_48a4cbe69bbb425a4821d43120a6095104da29d02968f019093d73952bada94b"],"source_ids":["src_aa3a00d6d7ab5ff7b5801bbcc485ea9b"],"text":"The /fractal skill takes a plain-language directive, distills NODE.md instructions and a parameter table, asks for anything it could not infer, and launches the node in a tmux session once approved.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_636240a2f69e93500e7e4b8ac2d65f1f31b0d95b4afa7fd55c0737bdabf90a55","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"plasma-ai/fractal@18793200c0d7 snapshot 448057f9da1ad062","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_353fc0fe4fdd9da87979cdbfd21870a66c1c294c2088f0c68275484b6121a207","slc_b321baff5dcfc4cf44fa229bfd972c2411897731605f0aa5f29116e941375ca3","slc_d35b80b493cb1e9bd633f7fac1f24143f3fb693c692d59ca915908fcb629a8a7"],"source_ids":["src_aa3a00d6d7ab5ff7b5801bbcc485ea9b","src_b3ac798603eb52eb84536fdc15ef8485"],"text":"Repository development practice: the test suite runs with pytest and --doctest-modules, and integration tests create real git repositories and worktrees, session-scoped to avoid repeated node-init overhead.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_67119f3542a0adba768ff8a080c6c85d931708962c7b17ba3befcde6bc9afece","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"plasma-ai/fractal@18793200c0d7 snapshot 448057f9da1ad062","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5cd470baeae11a120f6dde28da6e17ebc062d4ec4cd18677c048c01caf2646b1","slc_693d3bba5416b61830ebbf39e54eb3519a2de70f9dd955ec01994e806669cfd3","slc_813da4fd9e3f7fd8f3cf8a3a1cd98d7c614ea20de2934d474604625a70d35fd9","slc_b591cd3aaf3668f395cbaae50c0390a144b1b6a1ac33db392b630ef36492d040"],"source_ids":["src_aa3a00d6d7ab5ff7b5801bbcc485ea9b"],"text":"Repository development practice: pull requests should branch from and target 'dev' rather than 'main', which advances only at releases; setup uses install.sh or uv sync with pre-commit hooks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7353749749fe72459707aca87dcf12fcf1bb6fd4852ceb9398ad26fc5fe2b76f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"plasma-ai/fractal@18793200c0d7 snapshot 448057f9da1ad062","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2eb357e709185f6936ab61f3fb90c1589bb4bd4d636a58a1be1651a92083c71d"],"source_ids":["src_aa3a00d6d7ab5ff7b5801bbcc485ea9b"],"text":"Each loop is bounded by hard caps on iterations, depth, children, cost, and time, and an operator can steer or stop it at any point.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_aac1b603c26d0a704e01a646184d33f08e271fdab997e7b1ea52410684c2a583","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"plasma-ai/fractal@18793200c0d7 snapshot 448057f9da1ad062","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2eb357e709185f6936ab61f3fb90c1589bb4bd4d636a58a1be1651a92083c71d","slc_d301f5bcf5f4d325605f46c6beba4e1087c0607a0c0729d2c448f9f1521bd0d2"],"source_ids":["src_aa3a00d6d7ab5ff7b5801bbcc485ea9b"],"text":"All state — runs, iterations, steps, costs, and signals — is tracked in a local SQLite database that can be interacted with live in a terminal UI.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ca8d630fc8b0ba34f6e1291385fabc70f4b6bd1706ab8de0fb0a8a679efef197","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"plasma-ai/fractal@18793200c0d7 snapshot 448057f9da1ad062","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2eb357e709185f6936ab61f3fb90c1589bb4bd4d636a58a1be1651a92083c71d","slc_d301f5bcf5f4d325605f46c6beba4e1087c0607a0c0729d2c448f9f1521bd0d2"],"source_ids":["src_aa3a00d6d7ab5ff7b5801bbcc485ea9b"],"text":"Agent loops arrange into a tree of git worktrees: a node iterates toward a goal and spawns child nodes for separable subtasks, so the tree grows to fit the problem rather than following a fixed plan.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d37ffad7aee44c8cc1ccf58e09bc7ab4d59413fea5ed4948e551f8dee681a5e2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"plasma-ai/fractal@18793200c0d7 snapshot 448057f9da1ad062","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1219361ac47e71c7682ba7a81d207c5f76cfb06bfe10eb8e8c3cab340e9e6d99","slc_59854d98a2f84ef90216a198cf724d5b45fb6e0ff39b81e40778095bfd457633","slc_6eae663b039d7a9c887e392d19f875e64f1b44169bd2b086b6f389ed173055fb","slc_b2b4a2d612a7f4b03fbfe0c4c97a1182b5d765d9c7baf1f5a752e050ebf40413","slc_d1c8f92a86b229851b46e158210ed5ac2867bc5c0d59cf6f00222310aedbc28e"],"source_ids":["src_aa3a00d6d7ab5ff7b5801bbcc485ea9b"],"text":"The fractal skill can be installed via plugin marketplace for Claude Code and Codex, or via 'fractal install', which copies or symlinks skills into ~/.claude/skills and ~/.agents/skills.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","created_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_fbda7301173f5d07e230dd79c0f3eec4e0177d2bf7b5d88132926368e900fd47","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"plasma-ai/fractal@18793200c0d7 snapshot 448057f9da1ad062","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_f87f044dad5be8238c9099598eef5d5a3d408aaa067349e4be126e18a882bc4d"],"source_ids":["src_aa3a00d6d7ab5ff7b5801bbcc485ea9b"],"text":"Five agent backends are supported — Claude Code, Codex, Grok Build, OpenCode, and Oh My Pi — selected per node with --agent, with OpenRouter routing available via --provider=openrouter or native model ids.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:31:11Z","updated_by_operation":"op_f8909e523a7743ddb94dd5b5fdd7d3b9"}
